{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/05/1647456/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ズートピア観てきました( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キツネのニックがイケメン過ぎて\n惚れ惚れしました。\n女の子はみんな好きになると思う。\nネタバレできないから細かく言えないけど\n橋の下のシーンがとてつもなく好き。\nニックほんとにすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもキャラとして好きなのは\nナマケモノのフラッシュ！\nフラッシュ愛おしすぎて、\nフィギュア集めたい欲が爆発中。\n何から集めようかな(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなディズニー作品ベスト3に\n入るかもしれない勢い。\nとりあえずもう一回観に行く。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知県岡崎市での"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第２３回将棋まつり\n市制施行100周年　特別記念講演会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/05/1647456/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"講演会というかトークショーのような形で\nかなり砕けたお話もしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡辺竜王の容赦ない突っ込みが炸裂して\nとっても面白かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岡崎市は家康生誕の地として\n有名な観光地ということで\n今回は観光は出来なかったので\n次回はいろいろ周ってみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お越し下さった皆様！\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GWは握手なウィーク(^o^)！\n毎年恒例となりつつありますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋京都にて全握個握4日間\n開催されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都個握は本日開催中(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せたい写メたくさんあるから\n今日は2都市の全握だけ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/05/1647456/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋全握はかなちゃんと初ペア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/05/1647456/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都全握は若様と2回目のペア！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも話が弾むレーンで\nとっても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなちゃんファンの皆様\n若様ファンの皆様\nお世話になりました(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/05/05/1647456/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ムービー見たけどあれめっちゃ恥ずかしくなかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→顔から火が出そうだったよ。(笑)\nでも、甘々なことが苦手な私だけど\n乃木恋やってくれた人達だけへの\nスペシャルプレゼント！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋世界6月号発売中です(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月号は将棋フォーカスでもお馴染み\n村山先生に\n教えていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非是非皆様ご覧ください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type"